## files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.

.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.code-workspace

# Build outputs and temporary artifacts
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

