installer/payload/

# Strict documentation exclusion policy:
# ONLY the root README.md may ever be pushed to remote GitHub repositories.
# All other docs, specs, guides, session logs, and trial projects must be excluded.
*.md
**/*.md
!/README.md
!/readme.md
docs/
*.pdf
*.docx
*.ssot.json
session_handoff.md
AAA_Quality_Checklist.md
CDE_BOOT_FILES_MANIFEST.md
CDE_Folder_Structure_Map.md
